Package: appusageR
Title: Process and Summarize 'Android' Smartphone-Use Logs
Version: 0.3.11
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Kunru", "Song", email = "Kunrusong97@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             comment = "Lead compiler and copyright holder of the bundled dictionary"),
      person("Xin", "Jin", role = "ctb",
             comment = "Assisted compilation of the bundled dictionary"),
      person("Changshu", "Zhang", role = "ctb",
             comment = "Assisted compilation of the bundled dictionary"))
Description: Processes smartphone-use logs exported by 'APP Usage' and
    'Screen Time' on 'Android' for behavioral and mobile-sensing research.
    Parses and standardizes records, reconstructs usage episodes, and summarizes
    daily application use. Provides quality control reports, application
    categories from a manual dictionary, and links to self-report data.
    Per-file caches and memory-aware parallel workflows support project
    processing, recovery from interruptions, and independent updates to quality
    control and category annotations.
